pear-trees-site/
│
├── index.html          ← Homepage: hero, intro, overview
├── gallery.html        ← Gallery: semantic figure grid
├── updates.html        ← Updates: date-driven posts
├── contact.html        ← Contact: accessible form
├── products.html       ← Products (coming soon)
├── _data/
│   └── updates.json    ← Update metadata (for future JS enhancements)
├── css/
│   └── styles.css      ← Core styles with variables
└── js/
    ├── main.js         ← Site-wide interactivity
    └── hideProducts.js ← Logic to hide/enable products link